<!--
    Overlay on Playnite Default/Media.xaml.
    Icon set: Material Icons, filled (@material-design-icons/svg 0.14.15, Apache-2.0, LICENSE-material-icons.txt), the
    set @mui/icons-material wraps. Filled geometries on the 24px canvas; SvgIcon's default size is 24px.
    Path data is the SVG source with explicit separators.

    Keys every kit defines (kit templates reference them with DynamicResource): ShadcnIcon{Search, Clear, ViewSettings, FilterPresets, Group, Sort, DetailsView, GridView, ListView, Update, Explorer, Random, ViewRandom, Filter, Notifications, MainMenu, Library, Statistics, WindowMinimize, WindowMaximize, WindowRestore, WindowClose}
    and ShadcnIconTemplate. A kit with another icon set replaces this file whole.

    Playnite copies TextBlock icon resources (menus, sidebar items) by glyph, font and foreground only, so those
    stay icofont glyphs; the kit only drops Playnite's colors, so menu icons follow the item text. Sidebar Library and Statistics get set
    icons through CustomControls/SidebarItem.xaml.
-->
